{"title": "Dagger Thrower", "pageid": 20346, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dagger_Thrower", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Dagger Thrower</b> is passive feature that lets a creature add double their <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency Bonus\">Proficiency Bonus</a> to the damage made with ranged dagger attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This creature adds double their Proficiency Bonus to the damage they deal on ranged attacks made with daggers. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_Guildhall_DaggerThrower</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_Guildhall_DaggerThrower\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_Guildhall_DaggerThrower\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\">Nine-Fingers Keene</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203127\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited